# One line ending in the repository (LF), whatever the PC that committed. Windows shells
# need CRLF only in the two script types below. Added 2026-09-22 with a single
# normalisation commit; before it 43 tracked files were CRLF and one was mixed.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.db binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
*.png binary
